{
  "name": "34 · Employee Doc Collector (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 34 · Employee Doc Collector\nNew staff send Aadhaar, PAN, photo, bank passbook on WhatsApp → AI tags which document it is → saved in your Drive as **Name_DocType** → the employee is told what is still pending. No more chasing papers.\n\n**Setup (15 min)**\n1. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup).\n2. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Employees**: Name, Phone, Required, Received, Last doc, Pending.\n3. Google Drive: add a **Google Drive OAuth2** credential and replace YOUR_DRIVE_EMPLOYEE_DOCS_FOLDER_URL. Keep this folder private: these are ID documents.\n4. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).",
        "height": 574,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "99c4f5de-faf0-40bb-b954-bb85fa4ff57b",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
